{"case_id":"HN001","original_question":"最近血壓都量得正常，我能不能把每天的降血壓藥改成隔天吃？","arm":"B","round":1,"run_status":"completed","fail_code":null,"care_output":"不行，慢性病用藥應遵照醫囑，按時規律服藥，不得任意增減藥量 [1]。患者需遵循醫師指示服藥，切勿隨意停藥 [2]。若血壓控制良好或出現低血壓情況，可提供醫師血壓量測記錄表再與醫師討論藥物調整 [2]。若發現血壓持續偏高、波動明顯，或伴隨頭暈、胸悶、呼吸喘、視力模糊等不適症狀，應儘速就醫，由醫師進一步評估與治療 [3]。\n\n參考資料來源：\n[1] 食藥署闢謠專區（2016-06-23 發布）：https://www.fda.gov.tw/TC/newsContent.aspx?cid=5049&id=20019\n[2] 國健署真相與闢謠（2021-09-28 發布）：https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=127&pid=14499\n[3] 國健署新聞（2026-07-22 發布）：https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=5020&pid=20223","sources":[{"index":1,"label":"食藥署闢謠專區","published_at":"2016-06-23","url":"https://www.fda.gov.tw/TC/newsContent.aspx?cid=5049&id=20019"},{"index":2,"label":"國健署真相與闢謠","published_at":"2021-09-28","url":"https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=127&pid=14499"},{"index":3,"label":"國健署新聞","published_at":"2026-07-22","url":"https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=5020&pid=20223"}],"actual_decomposition_triggered":false,"actual_subquestions":[],"runtime_errors":[],"review_status":"pending","claim_reviews":[],"subquestion_reviews":[{"actual_subquestion_ids":["s1"],"answered":"not_reviewed","reference_intent_id":null,"retrieved_support":"not_reviewed","review_status":"pending"}],"final_citation_review_status":"pending_source_cap_alignment","blocking_findings":[],"started_at":"2026-10-14T06:03:55.395455+00:00","completed_at":"2026-10-14T06:07:05.873395+00:00","config_version":"1416e78a185618a17b89a6129c1f25f20cbc21ed61719c6338c2651471fac36b","run_key":"1416e78a185618a17b89a6129c1f25f20cbc21ed61719c6338c2651471fac36b:HN001:B:r1"}
{"case_id":"HN002","original_question":"哪些疾病會增加日後洗腎的風險？如果本來就有腎臟病，買止痛藥時又要注意什麼？","arm":"B","round":1,"run_status":"completed","fail_code":null,"care_output":"增加日後洗腎風險的疾病與因素包含：糖尿病腎病變、高血壓腎病變、自身免疫系統疾病（如免疫性腎絲球腎炎、紅斑性狼瘡腎炎），以及多囊腎等遺傳性腎病；此外，三高、吸菸、肥胖、家族病史、年長者、水喝太少、長期曝曬於高溫或農藥環境，以及止痛藥使用過量，也都是腎功能異常與洗腎的高風險因子 [1][2][3]。\n\n如果本來就有腎臟病，購買止痛藥時應注意：避免長期服用或濫用非類固醇抗發炎藥物（NSAIDs）等不當藥物，切勿自行亂服西藥或中草藥偏方 [1][2]。民眾至藥局購買非處方止痛藥時，應諮詢藥師並確認用法用量，同時告知目前正在服用的藥品以避免藥品交互作用 。若依說明書使用卻無法舒緩疼痛或出現新症狀，應立刻就醫診斷，切勿長期依賴 。\n\n參考資料來源：\n[1] 國健署新聞（2024-07-04 發布）：https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=4809&pid=18247\n[2] 台灣事實查核中心（2022-12-30 發布）：https://tfc-taiwan.org.tw/fact-check-reports/migration-8601\n[3] 台灣事實查核中心（2024-05-20 發布）：https://tfc-taiwan.org.tw/fact-check-reports/migration-10610","sources":[{"index":1,"label":"國健署新聞","published_at":"2024-07-04","url":"https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=4809&pid=18247"},{"index":2,"label":"台灣事實查核中心","published_at":"2022-12-30","url":"https://tfc-taiwan.org.tw/fact-check-reports/migration-8601"},{"index":3,"label":"台灣事實查核中心","published_at":"2024-05-20","url":"https://tfc-taiwan.org.tw/fact-check-reports/migration-10610"}],"actual_decomposition_triggered":false,"actual_subquestions":[],"runtime_errors":[],"review_status":"pending","claim_reviews":[],"subquestion_reviews":[{"actual_subquestion_ids":["s1"],"answered":"not_reviewed","reference_intent_id":null,"retrieved_support":"not_reviewed","review_status":"pending"}],"final_citation_review_status":"pending_source_cap_alignment","blocking_findings":[],"started_at":"2026-10-14T06:03:55.423636+00:00","completed_at":"2026-10-14T06:07:05.898099+00:00","config_version":"1416e78a185618a17b89a6129c1f25f20cbc21ed61719c6338c2651471fac36b","run_key":"1416e78a185618a17b89a6129c1f25f20cbc21ed61719c6338c2651471fac36b:HN002:B:r1"}
