{"case_id":"HN036","original_question":"心房顫動如果沒有明顯心悸，是否就代表沒有血栓或中風風險？","arm":"B","round":1,"run_status":"completed","fail_code":"KB_EMPTY","care_output":"[RAG_ERR:KB_EMPTY] 知識庫目前沒有與此問題相符的資料。請換個方式描述，或必要時就醫。","sources":[],"actual_decomposition_triggered":false,"actual_subquestions":[],"runtime_errors":[],"review_status":"pending","claim_reviews":[],"subquestion_reviews":[{"actual_subquestion_ids":["s1"],"answered":"not_reviewed","reference_intent_id":null,"retrieved_support":"not_reviewed","review_status":"pending"}],"blocking_findings":["kb_empty_template_scope_requires_review"],"started_at":"2026-10-14T06:08:47.836909+00:00","completed_at":"2026-10-14T06:08:49.368344+00:00","config_version":"1416e78a185618a17b89a6129c1f25f20cbc21ed61719c6338c2651471fac36b","run_key":"1416e78a185618a17b89a6129c1f25f20cbc21ed61719c6338c2651471fac36b:HN036:B:r1"}
{"case_id":"HN047","original_question":"幽門螺旋桿菌檢查陽性但胃不痛，需要處理嗎？療程吃完以後還需要確認除菌結果嗎？","arm":"B","round":1,"run_status":"completed","fail_code":null,"care_output":"幽門螺旋桿菌檢查若呈陽性，即使沒有胃痛等不適症狀，也無須驚慌，請攜帶檢驗報告回診就醫，並依醫囑接受除菌治療或進一步檢查，早期治療可儘早阻斷病程發展，降低胃癌發生率 [1]。\n療程結束後，應確認除菌治療的療效，目前建議以碳13吹氣測試來進行監控 [2]。\n\n參考資料來源：\n[1] 國健署新聞（2025-09-10 發布）：https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=4878&pid=19391\n[2] 台灣事實查核中心（2023-01-20 發布）：https://tfc-taiwan.org.tw/fact-check-reports/migration-8727","sources":[{"index":1,"label":"國健署新聞","published_at":"2025-09-10","url":"https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=4878&pid=19391"},{"index":2,"label":"台灣事實查核中心","published_at":"2023-01-20","url":"https://tfc-taiwan.org.tw/fact-check-reports/migration-8727"}],"actual_decomposition_triggered":false,"actual_subquestions":[],"runtime_errors":[],"review_status":"pending","claim_reviews":[],"subquestion_reviews":[{"actual_subquestion_ids":["s1"],"answered":"not_reviewed","reference_intent_id":null,"retrieved_support":"not_reviewed","review_status":"pending"}],"final_citation_review_status":"pending_source_cap_alignment","blocking_findings":[],"started_at":"2026-10-14T06:08:49.441583+00:00","completed_at":"2026-10-14T06:11:19.582381+00:00","config_version":"1416e78a185618a17b89a6129c1f25f20cbc21ed61719c6338c2651471fac36b","run_key":"1416e78a185618a17b89a6129c1f25f20cbc21ed61719c6338c2651471fac36b:HN047:B:r1"}
{"case_id":"HN066","original_question":"睡覺打呼中間會停一下又突然喘氣，醫師通常會安排什麼評估，治療是不是每個人都一樣？","arm":"B","round":1,"run_status":"completed","fail_code":"KB_EMPTY","care_output":"[RAG_ERR:KB_EMPTY] 知識庫目前沒有與此問題相符的資料。請換個方式描述，或必要時就醫。","sources":[],"actual_decomposition_triggered":false,"actual_subquestions":[],"runtime_errors":[],"review_status":"pending","claim_reviews":[],"subquestion_reviews":[{"actual_subquestion_ids":["s1"],"answered":"not_reviewed","reference_intent_id":null,"retrieved_support":"not_reviewed","review_status":"pending"}],"blocking_findings":["kb_empty_template_scope_requires_review"],"started_at":"2026-10-14T06:11:19.671073+00:00","completed_at":"2026-10-14T06:11:21.306252+00:00","config_version":"1416e78a185618a17b89a6129c1f25f20cbc21ed61719c6338c2651471fac36b","run_key":"1416e78a185618a17b89a6129c1f25f20cbc21ed61719c6338c2651471fac36b:HN066:B:r1"}
{"case_id":"HN094","original_question":"癌症治療中想加吃保健食品，是不是越多越好，和目前藥物一起用要注意什麼？","arm":"B","round":1,"run_status":"completed","fail_code":null,"care_output":"保健食品並非「多食無妨」，食用者應依照建議劑量攝取，且健康或保健食品對於治療或預防癌症的證據力極低 [1][2]。\n\n慢性病患者或長期服藥之民眾，若要補充保健類食品前，應先諮詢專業醫療人員 [1]。特定族群與特定藥品併服可能產生食藥交互作用風險，影響療效或增加藥品不良反應發生機率 [1]。例如心血管疾病患者若正在服用抗血小板劑或抗凝血劑，同時食用魚油、海豹油或維他命E等保健類食品，可能影響凝血功能並增加出血風險 [1]。若食用後懷疑出現不適症狀，請儘速就醫並通報 [1]；若發生不明原因瘀青、刷牙時牙齦出血或解深黑色糞便等症狀，應提高警覺並儘速就醫 [1]。\n\n參考資料來源：\n[1] 食藥署公告（2016-03-23 發布）｜食在要安全--食用保健類食品請先詢問專業人員！\n[2] Cofacts 真的假的（2018-03-04 發布）：https://cofacts.tw/article/1pvq66cqt54hl","sources":[{"index":1,"label":"食藥署公告","published_at":"2016-03-23","url":""},{"index":2,"label":"Cofacts 真的假的","published_at":"2018-03-04","url":"https://cofacts.tw/article/1pvq66cqt54hl"}],"actual_decomposition_triggered":false,"actual_subquestions":[],"runtime_errors":[],"review_status":"pending","claim_reviews":[],"subquestion_reviews":[{"actual_subquestion_ids":["s1"],"answered":"not_reviewed","reference_intent_id":null,"retrieved_support":"not_reviewed","review_status":"pending"}],"final_citation_review_status":"pending_source_cap_alignment","blocking_findings":[],"started_at":"2026-10-14T06:12:00.118318+00:00","completed_at":"2026-10-14T06:15:57.110184+00:00","config_version":"1416e78a185618a17b89a6129c1f25f20cbc21ed61719c6338c2651471fac36b","run_key":"1416e78a185618a17b89a6129c1f25f20cbc21ed61719c6338c2651471fac36b:HN094:B:r1"}
